tinyriscv_project_mod

This project is a course-project modification of tinyriscV.

Original project:
  https://gitee.com/liangkangnan/tinyriscv

Original tinyriscV source files are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, as indicated by their file headers.

Major project modifications in this repository include:
  - reduced SoC top for course FPGA/tapeout validation;
  - off-chip ROM/RAM bridge between chip RTL and FPGA-side memory model;
  - four-channel PWM peripheral;
  - I2C/LM75 temperature-read peripheral;
  - shared UART path for MMIO and custom-instruction transmission;
  - project custom instructions sID, rT, and if/ifire;
  - chip_sel_i selection signal for future multi-chip IO Ring sharing;
  - simulation testbenches and verification documentation.

PDKs, commercial EDA setup files, standard-cell libraries, IO pad libraries,
and foundry-specific collateral are intentionally not included.

